{"instruction":"Please run the following on your phone to ensure it’s using at least 4G/5G for MMS:

set_network_mode_preference(mode="4g_5g_preferred")

Let me know once you’ve completed that step."}

{"instruction":"Please reseat your SIM card by running the action:

reseat_sim_card()

This will ensure your SIM is properly connected. Let me know once you’ve completed this step."}
